                  %mo{:lspace => "0em", :rspace => "thinmathspace"} Mod
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi T
                    %mn 2
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \operatorname{Mod} (T_1) \simeq \operatorname{Mod} (T_2)
            does not necessarily imply that the two theories are
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Morita+equivalent"} Morita equivalent
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi P
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P_1
            and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi P
